  "limitations": [
    "experimental async resource profile remains rejected; native frame tests are not a cross-language async resource qualification",
    "generated owned-resource argument cleanup for cancellation before start and owned-result return/cancel races remains unfinished",
    "borrow lifetime at task.return versus later EXIT must be implemented before enabling exported borrowed arguments",
    "lease retirement currently follows the C frame ownership boundary; early acknowledgement/handoff behavior must be qualified when resource adapters are enabled",
    "public --guest-c async output and public future/stream guest values remain guarded",
    "WASI AsyncLocalStorage constructor/link packaging gap remains; native ALS foundation is preserved",
    "guest checkpoints exclude timers and foreign native I/O",
    "no new coherent full native compiler/runtime/stdlib/engine distribution set or macOS/Windows/package qualification",
    "existing fixture TypeScript strict checking was not rerun",
    "inherited address/root-holder/file-size failures remain byte-identical; no new waivers or dependencies"
  ],
